Relationship to the R implementation
------------------------------------

`mcmarcel-rs/` is a rewrite of the McMarcel R project that lives in the parent directory. The R
code is the validation oracle for the rewrite and remains the reference implementation of the
model; it is not called at runtime. Because both are distributed under the GNU General Public
License version 3 or later, the obligations of that licence apply to this rewrite as well: any
derivative distribution must keep the licence, provide the corresponding source and state the
changes.

